title: "Thali: voice-controlled bimanual table setting on an Intel laptop"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Thakur
    given-names: Prashant
repository-code: "https://github.com/Prashant-thakur77/THALI"
