license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - bimanual manipulation
  - vision-language-action
  - OpenVINO
  - MuJoCo
  - SO-101
  - Speechmatics
abstract: >-
  Two simulated SO-101 arms set and clear a dinner table from spoken commands. Speechmatics realtime speech,
  a local Qwen2-VL planner on OpenVINO, a deterministic safety verifier with a sha256-chained audit log,
  learned ACT / SmolVLA skills with a scripted inverse-kinematics fallback, camera and Anomalib checks,
  follow-up corrections and concurrent two-arm execution. Every number in the README is rendered from results files.
